# Derived tables. The .md, .json and .png artifacts here are the run of record
# and ARE committed (force-added past the repo-root `outputs/` rule), because
# RESULTS.md quotes them and a reader should not have to spend 35 minutes of CPU
# to check a number. CSV is only ever an export of the JSON, so it is noise in
# review and is regenerated by re-running analyze.py.
